  "layoutNotes": [
    "Leather package two-tone colours contrast the instrument cowl, seat centres, door grips/armrests and storage lid. Full two-tone leather also separates dark upper surfaces from the lighter lower interior.",
    "GTS Alcantara areas stay black. Red/silver contrasts are stitching and logos, not a blanket red/silver surface. Existing unlinked stitching and logo geometry is retained.",
    "Bare OEM numbers often omit colour and option suffixes. Existing OEM links are retained; current vehicle settings control the displayed upholstery variant.",
    "The linked 9P1419091ECA34 steering wheel is described as leather/carbon and belongs to 982/991.2 catalogues. This visual review does not establish 981 fitment.",
    "2026-10-11 additions: Galvano Silver strips stay silver; shift boot/grip follow vehicle upholstery independently of the silver insert. Windbreak/net source textures and cutouts are retained. Functional grouping follows explicit OEM descriptions without changing model identifiers or stored associations. Restored large visor bodies 006/007 belong to liner.",
    "Dashboard upper OEM 98155210120: all disconnected surfaces of dashboard__interior__assembly and dashboard__interior_016__01 follow upper colour/upholstery. Passenger airbag-cover layers are not a contrasting instrument cowl; explicit cowl OEM rules remain separate.",
    "Door 054 keeps the upper shell in the primary colour. Its disconnected pull/armrest uses the second colour in leather packages and full two-tone interiors; the small lower insert contrasts in full two-tone only. Named left/right 092 pieces remain brushed silver. Safety-belt webbing, metal tongue, plastic fittings and release-button source graphics stay separate."
  ],
